      "content": "On dissolving 0.5 g of a non-volatile non-ionic solute to 39 g of benzene, its vapor pressure decreases from 650 mmHg to 640 mmHg. The depression of freezing point of benzene (in K) upon addition of the solute is .............<br><br>(Given data: Molar mass and the molal freezing point depression constant of benzene are 78 g mol<sup>-1</sup> and 5.12 K kg mol<sup>-1</sup>, respectively).",
      "options": [],
